  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-composter-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>More Composter Variants</h1>\n<p>Заполните свои постройки яркой органической переработкой: теперь у каждого типа дерева есть свой компостер.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/p7e0d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Добавляет 12 новых компостеров в Minecraft.</h2>\n<h4>Эти компостеры также можно скрафтить с помощью <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-woodcutter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's Woodcutter</a>.</h4>\n<hr>\n<h2>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/ongzm.gif\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;<sup>Текстуры Pale Oak от <strong><em>hunnycakehorse</em></strong></sup></a></h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>Совместимо с заменой блоков в <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+:</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/c8j6v.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\nЕсли посмотреть на фермера в деревне саванны: мы увидим, что вместо обычного <em>компостера</em> и <em>дубовых факелов</em> игра теперь генерирует деревню с <em><strong>компостером из акации</strong></em> и <em><strong>акациевыми факелами</strong></em> (из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Torch Variants</a>).</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
